<title>USA: Federated says Dec same-store sales flat.</title>
<headline>Federated says Dec same-store sales flat.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $2.743     $2.902	+5.5	  nil</p>
<p>Year-to-date   $14.487    $14.181	+2.2	 +2.8</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is	5 weeks ended	   Jan 4.</p>
<p>    Full company name is   Federated Department Stores Inc</p>
<p>Total sales for November-December were $4.29 billion, and up 3.2 pct for comp-store sales.</p>
<p>Total sales for yr-ago Dec were higher than this year because they reflected revs from all of the 82 Broadway stores acquired by Federated.  Total Dec sales for this year reflect only revs from those Broadway store properties that subsequently were converted to Federated nameplates - a total of 56 stores as of Jan 4.</p>
</text>
